## Correction

PR #76 was based on an incorrect reading of the A-Islands schema. The peer-reviewed data paper's Table 2 explicitly lists `List_ID` and `Island_ID` in `island_data`, and Table 3 links `species_data` to `island_data` via `List_ID`.

## Fix

- restore list-to-island mapping rather than treating `island_data` as one row per island;
- preserve set-based unique-island counting so repeated flora lists do not inflate prevalence;
- accept capitalization differences documented between the preprint (`list_ID`, `island_ID`, `species_update`) and peer-reviewed table (`List_ID`, `Island_ID`, `Species_update`) without changing semantics;
- restore regression tests for repeated lists.

## Scope

No eligibility threshold or EOG outcome is changed. This corrects the data-ingestion contract before any A-Islands benchmark outcome is computed.
